OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with rural frost
OL,6,Fand fog. A mix of sunshine and showers
OL,7,Ffollow, some heavy with the odd rumble
OL,8,Fof thunder, these easing by the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers fading, with a dry
OL,12,Fand mostly clear night following.
OL,13,FFeeling chilly, with rural frost and
OL,14,Ffog forming by dawn.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FMostly dry with sunny spells
OL,17,Ffor many. Light winds and remaining
OL,18,Fcold for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
