OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fchilly start with patchy frost and fog
OL,7,Fon Sunday, but dry spells with
OL,8,Fsunshine follow. Cloudier and breezier
OL,9,Fby Monday, with rain possible through
OL,10,FTuesday and temperatures nearer
OL,11,Faverage.
